&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers. The kind of people who not only created composable commerce but also shaped the culture of experimentation that idea unlocked. Together they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce, but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello! I&#39;m &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/christina-helm/&quot;&gt;Christina&lt;/a&gt;, Senior Manager of Business Development at commercetools. My team focuses on &lt;strong&gt;lead qualification&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;outbound prospecting&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;pipeline generation&lt;/strong&gt; to connect marketing efforts with sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Representative (BDR)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as the crucial bridge between our Marketing and Sales teams. In this role, you will drive new business opportunities by identifying, reaching out to, and building meaningful relationships with potential customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To excel in this position, you should have proven experience generating and qualifying leads from marketing campaigns, paired with exceptional communication skills to establish trust with prospective clients. Ultimately, your efforts will directly impact revenue growth and fuel our long-term business success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will focus on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building pipeline through outbound prospecting - research, multi-channel outreach, and persistent follow-up across an account list&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualifying inbound leads from marketing campaigns and converting them into sales-ready opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running qualification conversations that surface a prospect’s commerce challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Booking qualified meetings for Account Executives and setting them up to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing commercetools at industry-leading events, from conference floors to executive dinners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with your AEs on account strategy and territory planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping Salesforce current so your pipeline tells an accurate story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staying fluent in our platform, our market, and how we’re positioned against alternatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you driven, hard-working, and eager to launch your career in a high-energy, collaborative environment? We’d love to connect!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is in-office, with five days a week spent in our Boston office. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how businesses work, and the drive to understand a prospect’s world before pitching into it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience - this is a role where most outreach goes unanswered, and the people who succeed treat that as information rather than rejection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise communication, written and spoken; you can hold a business conversation with a senior stakeholder and keep it moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-direction and consistency - nobody will tell you how to spend every hour, and the results compound over weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with learning new technology and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; a genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Salesforce or a sales engagement tool like Gong Engage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in commerce, retail, or B2B software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in a role where you persuaded people for a living - teaching, recruiting, hospitality, customer service, fundraising, account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;For more information on our diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging practices, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/dei-esg&quot;&gt;visit this page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the compensation range pertains to base pay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$70,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers. The kind of people who not only created composable commerce but also shaped the culture of experimentation that idea unlocked. Together they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce, but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation Manager, &lt;/strong&gt;you will own pipeline generation for commercetools focusing on one of the specific industry sectors that we market to. You sit within the Demand Generation team and are responsible for turning vertical-specific insight into campaigns, programs, and events that generate qualified pipeline.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Strategy &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and run the full-funnel demand gen plan; multi-channel campaigns, ABM programs, and always-on nurture tracks targeting priority accounts and personas in the sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event &amp;amp; Field Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and prioritize the industry events, conferences, and executive roundtables where the vertical&#39;s buyers show up, and own end-to-end planning, budget, and follow-up to convert attendance into pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABM Program Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Sales and RevOps to identify target account lists and design tailored ABM plays (direct mail, targeted ads, personalized landing pages, 1:1 outreach support) for key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel &amp;amp; Program Selection:&lt;/strong&gt; Determine the right mix of channels — paid media, webinars, syndicated content, partner co-marketing, industry publications/newsletters and manage budget allocation across them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Case Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Take use cases, case studies, and messaging developed by Product Marketing and translate them into campaign assets, landing pages, and outreach sequences suited to this audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Reporting &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and report against pipeline/MQL/SQL targets for the vertical; run test-and-learn cycles across campaigns and continuously optimize based on performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; BDR Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Sales and BDR teams to ensure campaigns are timed, targeted, and followed up on effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a full-time hybrid position with three days a week spent in our Boston (MA) office.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative, execution-oriented marketer who&#39;s comfortable owning a number and figuring out the fastest path to it. You know how to translate industry nuance into campaigns that resonate with a specific, often risk-averse buyer, and you&#39;re equally comfortable planning an executive dinner and building a paid ABM sequence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Demand Generation, Performance Marketing, Account based Marketing, Industry Marketing or Growth Marketing within B2B SaaS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running multi-channel campaigns and ABM programs, from concept through to pipeline reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and executing field events, executive roundtables, or conference presence that reliably convert into pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills, comfortable working closely with Product Marketing (who provide use cases), Sales, and RevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with marketing and campaign tooling such as HubSpot, DemandBase, Navattic, and standard reporting/attribution tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Aptitude: a genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter; for campaign ideation, content drafting, targeting, or reporting and a drive to put them into practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in the Medtech/Healthcare (as you&#39;ll be targeting this industry sector)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community. For more information on our diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging practices, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/dei-esg&quot;&gt;visit this page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the compensation range pertains to base pay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$125,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers.The kind of people who not only pioneered a more flexible approach to commerce architecture but also shaped the culture of experimentation that approach unlocked. Together they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of autonomous commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce, but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Director of Demand Generation&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll support the Marketing team by owning the global strategy and execution for generating pipeline across our target enterprise accounts. Leading a multi-disciplinary team spanning Digital Marketing, ABX, Field &amp;amp; Regional Marketing, Corporate Events, and Web Experience, you will partner closely with Sales and Revenue Operations to turn demand into predictable revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Growth Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute an integrated, multi-channel global demand engine aligned with corporate ARR targets, market expansion goals, and key enterprise ICPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Scaling &amp;amp; Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, mentor, and expand a high-performing global team across ABX, Field Marketing, Digital, Web, and Events—fostering a culture of experimentation, accountability, and commercial excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Acceleration &amp;amp; ABX:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect targeted Account-Based Marketing strategies for enterprise accounts, driving both net-new logos and expansion within existing accounts across North America, EMEA, APAC, and LATAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish a rigorous, data-driven approach to track end-to-end conversion rates, pipeline velocity, CAC, ROMI and marketing-attributed/influenced pipeline across all channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; GTM Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a core partner to Global Sales leadership, unifying marketing targets with sales pipelines, optimizing lead-to-opportunity handoffs, and continuously aligning GTM execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI to Build for Scale: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify opportunities to scale marketing programs and outcomes by implementing new ways-of-working supported by AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Performance Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the global demand gen budget, making agile resource-allocation decisions backed by ROI analytics and attribution models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is hybrid, with three days a week spent in our Boston or London office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver and systems builder who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise B2B Software Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of progressive demand generation leadership in enterprise B2B SaaS/software (experience in headless/composable commerce, middleware, or developer-centric infrastructure is a major plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience leading and inspiring remote, cross-functional GTM teams across multiple regions and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced ABX &amp;amp; Digital Native:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of modern enterprise GTM plays, multi-touch attribution, data analytics, and modern martech stacks (CRM, Marketing Automation, Intent Data engines).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong business acumen with a passion for pipeline math, unit economics, and data-backed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with a demonstrated ability to align product, sales, finance, and executive stakeholders around unified growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine curiosity for using AI tools and capabilities to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✈️ Family Flex Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote work for a number of days a year to support family connectivity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
