&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Global BDR Function &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead and scale our Business Development Representative (BDR) organisation across AMER, EMEA, and APAC. Reporting directly to the Chief Marketing Officer (CMO), you will serve as a functional leader on the Marketing Leadership Team, driving predictable enterprise pipeline growth by implementing&amp;nbsp; global outbound motions, standardizing playbooks, and being hands-on with the global BDR team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the global functional lead for business development, partnering directly with the CMO to align the BDR function with overall demand generation campaigns, brand initiatives, and corporate pipeline targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with RevOps and Marketing to define, monitor, and optimize global Marketing–BDR SLAs, including funnel velocity, lead scoring models, speed-to-lead benchmarks, and inbound conversion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global team metrics against weekly discovery and qualified opportunity targets, providing direct, data-driven reporting to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage regional BDR teams fostering high-performance leadership standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global team retention strategies, structuring quality-weighted compensation frameworks and clear career pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and maintain a single global BDR playbook covering inbound and outbound architecture, multi-channel messaging (email, phone, social), and objection handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the People team to support&amp;nbsp; onboarding and enablement programs globally, incorporating formal certification milestones and structured peer-shadowing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with RevOps to optimize tool adoption, AI potential and workflow efficiencies across Salesforce, Clay, Outreach, Gong/Chorus, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and 6sense/intent data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is in office with five days a week spent in our (Boston MA or London UK) office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
