&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading distributed BDR/SDR organizations or managing regional team leads/managers across AMER, EMEA, or APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success partnering directly with Marketing Leadership (CMO/VPs) to convert marketing demand into qualified enterprise sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mastery of modern sales tech (Salesforce, Outreach/Salesloft, intent data, conversation intelligence) and funnel conversion analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Aptitude&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
