&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of full-cycle recruiting, 3+ years hiring enterprise sales/GTM at a SaaS or tech company with a strong ability to assess and hire top enterprise sales talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
