&lt;li&gt;Experience in defining hiring processes to assess and measure the quality and suitability of enterprise sales talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and flexibility to support hiring beyond the sales remit when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
