&lt;li&gt;A habit of staying current on talent acquisition trends, tools, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading talent acquisition projects for continued development of the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data to inform decisions &amp;amp; identify trends&lt;/li&gt;
